%% Door lock with key-event labels. Demonstrates _choice-driven branching:
%% Locked has multiple outbound labels (unlock_pin / unlock_fingerprint /
%% jiggle_handle) that lift to `_choice == "<label>"` guards.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Locked
    Locked --> Unlocking: unlock_pin
    Locked --> Unlocking: unlock_fingerprint
    Locked --> Locked: jiggle_handle
    Unlocking --> Unlocked
    Unlocked --> Locked: timeout
    Unlocked --> [*]
